<section class="cash-page bank-reconciliation-page">
  <div class="module-head"><div><div class="module-kicker">FINANCIAL OPERATIONS</div><h1>Rekonsiliasi Rekening</h1><p>Cocokkan saldo rekening yang Anda baca manual dengan pembayaran transfer dan QRIS yang sudah dikonfirmasi.</p></div><a class="btn-tech" href="/cash"><i class="bi bi-arrow-left"></i>Data Kas</a></div>
  <form class="filter-card" method="get"><div class="filter-grid">
    <div class="filter-group"><label>REKENING</label><select class="form-select" name="bank_id" required><% banks.forEach(b=>{ %><option value="<%= b.id %>" <%= bank&&Number(bank.id)===Number(b.id)?'selected':'' %>><%= b.bank_name %> · <%= b.account_number %> · <%= b.account_name %></option><% }) %></select></div>
    <div class="filter-group"><label>DARI TANGGAL</label><input class="form-control" type="date" name="from" value="<%= from %>" required></div>
    <div class="filter-group"><label>SAMPAI TANGGAL</label><input class="form-control" type="date" name="to" value="<%= to %>" required></div>
    <div class="filter-group d-flex align-items-end"><button class="btn-tech primary w-100" type="submit"><i class="bi bi-funnel"></i>Hitung</button></div>
  </div></form>
  <% if(!bank){ %><div class="data-card p-4">Tambahkan rekening aktif di pengaturan bank sebelum melakukan rekonsiliasi.</div><% }else if(from>to){ %><div class="data-card p-4">Tanggal awal harus sebelum tanggal akhir.</div><% }else{ %>
  <div class="data-card p-4"><h3><%= bank.bank_name %> · <%= bank.account_number %></h3><p class="text-secondary">Periode <%= from %> sampai <%= to %>. Nominal transfer/QRIS dihitung dari tanggal bayar yang berstatus confirmed dan tercatat pada rekening ini. Pembayaran tanpa rekening atau pada rekening lain tidak ikut dihitung.</p>
    <div class="row g-3"><div class="col-md-3"><small>Transfer/QRIS terkonfirmasi</small><strong class="d-block"><%= formatRupiah(transfer.total) %></strong><small><%= transfer.count %> pembayaran</small></div><% if(snapshot){ %><div class="col-md-3"><small>Saldo awal</small><strong class="d-block"><%= formatRupiah(snapshot.opening_balance) %></strong></div><div class="col-md-3"><small>Saldo akhir yang diinput</small><strong class="d-block"><%= formatRupiah(snapshot.closing_balance) %></strong></div><div class="col-md-3"><small>Selisih saldo akhir</small><strong class="d-block <%= Math.abs(difference)<0.01?'text-success':'text-danger' %>"><%= formatRupiah(difference) %></strong></div><% } %></div>
    <% if(snapshot){ %><hr><p>Perkiraan saldo akhir = saldo awal + transfer/QRIS + kredit lain − debit lain = <b><%= formatRupiah(expected) %></b>.</p><p class="text-secondary">Kredit lain <%= formatRupiah(snapshot.other_credits) %> · debit lain <%= formatRupiah(snapshot.other_debits) %>. <%= snapshot.note||'' %></p><% if(Math.abs(difference)>=0.01){ %><div class="alert alert-warning">Selisih perlu diperiksa terhadap mutasi bank: biaya admin, transfer masuk di luar aplikasi, transfer tertunda, atau pembayaran yang salah memilih rekening/tanggal.</div><% } %><% } %>
  </div>
  <% if(isMasterAdmin){ %><form class="data-card p-4 mt-3" method="post" action="/cash/bank-reconciliation"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>"><input type="hidden" name="bank_id" value="<%= bank.id %>"><input type="hidden" name="from" value="<%= from %>"><input type="hidden" name="to" value="<%= to %>"><h3>Input saldo dari mutasi rekening</h3><p class="text-secondary">Catat angka dari rekening bank. Kredit/debit lain menampung mutasi yang bukan pembayaran pelanggan, termasuk biaya administrasi.</p><div class="row g-3"><div class="col-md-3"><label class="form-label">Saldo awal</label><input class="form-control" type="number" step="0.01" name="opening_balance" value="<%= snapshot?Number(snapshot.opening_balance):0 %>" required></div><div class="col-md-3"><label class="form-label">Saldo akhir</label><input class="form-control" type="number" step="0.01" name="closing_balance" value="<%= snapshot?Number(snapshot.closing_balance):0 %>" required></div><div class="col-md-3"><label class="form-label">Kredit lain</label><input class="form-control" type="number" min="0" step="0.01" name="other_credits" value="<%= snapshot?Number(snapshot.other_credits):0 %>" required></div><div class="col-md-3"><label class="form-label">Debit lain / biaya</label><input class="form-control" type="number" min="0" step="0.01" name="other_debits" value="<%= snapshot?Number(snapshot.other_debits):0 %>" required></div><div class="col-12"><label class="form-label">Keterangan</label><textarea class="form-control" name="note" maxlength="500" rows="2" placeholder="Contoh: biaya admin dan transfer masuk di luar aplikasi"><%= snapshot?.note||'' %></textarea></div></div><button class="btn-tech primary mt-3" type="submit"><i class="bi bi-save"></i>Simpan Rekonsiliasi</button></form><% } %>
  <% } %>
</section>
